# Strata SDK: ApplicationForm — Views

Rules for building the view layer of an application form: layouts, question-page templates, shared partials, and index/show screens.

## application_form_views Generator

`Strata::Generators::ApplicationFormViewsGenerator` inspects the flow and form model, then renders one `edit_<page_name>.html.erb` per `question_page`, a layout file, and a locale YAML at `config/locales/<form_plural>/en.yml`.

Controllers receive these instance variables for use in layouts and templates:

| Name | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `@flow` | `ApplicationFormFlow` — `#task_counter`, `#start_path`, `#end_path` |
| `@flow_page` | `QuestionPage` — `#name` (validation context), completion state |
| `@flow_task` | `TaskEvaluator` — `#update_path`, `#prev_path`, `#next_path` |

```bash
bin/rails generate strata:application_form_views LeaveApplicationFormFlow LeaveApplicationForm
```

Field-helper detection order (first match wins):

1. Single-column Strata attribute type → `memorable_date`, `money_field`, `tax_id_field`, `date_picker`
2. Multi-column Strata attribute (presence of `<attr>_first` or `<attr>_street_line_1`) → `name`, `address_fields`
3. Enum → `fieldset` + `radio_button` per value (locale keys `<field>_legend` and `<field>_<value>`)
4. Boolean column → `yes_no`
5. Column type fallback → `date_picker`, `text_area`, or `text_field` (integer/decimal/float use `inputmode: "numeric"`)

Skipped fields: `*_attributes`, ActiveStorage attachments, anything not on the model.

## Layout Template (generated)

The layout wraps every question page with the exit link and step indicator, then yields the page body:

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("lib/generators/strata/application_form_views/templates/layout.html.erb.tt") %>
```

## Question Page Template (generated)

Each `edit_<page_name>.html.erb` is rendered from this template, with `@fields_content` filled in by the detected helpers:

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("lib/generators/strata/application_form_views/templates/edit_page.html.erb.tt") %>
```

## Shared Partials

### `strata/shared/_form_buttons` — Back + Save-and-continue buttons

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("app/views/strata/shared/_form_buttons.html.erb") %>
```

Render from a question page:

```erb
<%%= render partial: "strata/shared/form_buttons", locals: {
  back_path: @flow_task.prev_path || @flow.start_path,
  f: f
} %>
```

### `strata/shared/_exit_link` — Back-arrow exit link

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("app/views/strata/shared/_exit_link.html.erb") %>
```

### `strata/shared/_breadcrumbs` — USWDS breadcrumb trail

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("app/views/strata/shared/_breadcrumbs.html.erb") %>
```

Pass `breadcrumbs` as an array of `{ text:, link: }` hashes, or `content_for :breadcrumbs` to override.

### `strata/shared/_step_indicator` — USWDS step indicator

Required locals: `steps` (array of symbols/strings), `current_step`. Optional: `translation_scope` (default `"strata.application_forms.steps"`), `large_header`, `header_first`, `type: :counters`.

```erb
<%%= render partial: "strata/shared/step_indicator", locals: {
  steps: @flow_task.pages.map(&:name),
  current_step: @flow_task.current_page.name
} %>
```

Translation keys live under the provided scope, one per step name. Steps up to and including the current step are marked complete.

## Index View — `strata/application_forms/index`

Shared template for listing a user's application forms. Required locals: `title`, `intro`, `new_button_text`, `new_path`, `in_progress_applications_heading`, `application_forms` (array of `{ created_at:, path:, status: }`).

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("app/views/strata/application_forms/index.html.erb") %>
```

Render from a concrete controller:

```ruby
render template: "strata/application_forms/index", locals: {
  title: t(".title"),
  intro: t(".intro"),
  new_button_text: t(".new_button"),
  new_path: new_passport_application_form_path,
  in_progress_applications_heading: t(".in_progress_applications.heading"),
  application_forms: @application_forms.map { |f|
    { created_at: f.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p"),
      path: passport_application_form_path(f),
      status: f.status }
  }
}
```

## Show View — `strata/application_forms/show`

Shared template for the single-form landing page with a 3-step progress indicator (`in_progress`, `submitted`, `decision_made`). Required locals: `title`, `back_link_text`, `index_path`, `created_at`, `current_status`, `next_step`, `submitted_on_text`. Optional: `submitted_at` (shown only when `current_status == "submitted"`).

```erb
<%= read_sdk_file("app/views/strata/application_forms/show.html.erb") %>
```

## Required Translation Keys

Shared partials rely on these I18n keys — provide them in your host app:

| Key | Used by |
|-----|---------|
| `strata.form_builder.actions.back` | `_form_buttons` |
| `strata.form_builder.actions.save_and_continue` | `_form_buttons` |
| `strata.application_forms.steps.<step_name>` | `_step_indicator` (default scope) |
| `strata.application_forms.statuses.<status>` | `index.html.erb`, `_row.html.erb` |
| `strata.application_forms.index.col_created_at` / `col_status` / `col_actions` | index table headers |

The `application_form_views` generator also writes `config/locales/<form_plural>/en.yml` with `edit_<page>_title` and enum legend/option keys per page.
